# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

squares is project
squares purpose "Print the squares of 1 to 5; a stage0 sample that refined run and the built executable both run"
squares target console
squares version "0.1.0"
squares language refined 1
squares standardLibrary 1
squares allows write console.stdout none
squares requires none
squares includesModule squares
squares entry squares.main
